OL,3,ATrump makes fevered campaign push in
OL,4,Afinal weekend before election
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the last weekend before the pivotal
OL,7,Fmidterm elections, Donald Trump has
OL,8,Fmade a final pitch to voters in hopes
OL,9,Fof keeping Republicans in control of
OL,10,Fthe US Congress.
OL,12,FTrump held rallies in Florida, Iowa and
OL,13,FKansas - states he won in past
OL,14,Felections - in a sign of Republicans'
OL,15,Fdefensive stance in Tuesday's
OL,16,Felections.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
