OL,3,ATrump makes fevered campaign push in
OL,4,Afinal weekend before election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFacing voter frustration over rising
OL,7,Fprices, particularly fuel, Trump sought
OL,8,Fto tamp down such concerns and shift
OL,9,Ffocus on attacking Democrats, saying
OL,10,Fthey would "bankrupt" families if
OL,11,Felected.
OL,13,FPolls suggest that Democrats have a
OL,14,Fgood chance at winning at least partial
OL,15,Fcontrol of Congress, which would act as
OL,16,Fa check on Trump's power and upend the
OL,17,Flast two years of his presidency.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
